{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"杰夫·贝佐斯·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"jeff-bezos","categoryLabel":"杰夫·贝佐斯","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/09_jeff-bezos/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"代表成就\">代表成就</h1><p>衡量一个企业家的成就，最直接的尺子是他亲手造出了什么。1994 年贝佐斯在车库里注册 Amazon.com，1995 年网站上线，1997 年以约 4.38 亿美元市值在纳斯达克上市；到 2026 年，亚马逊市值已达约 2.6 万亿美元。这条增长曲线背后，是一连串改变了产业格局的具体作品。</p>\n<p>本卷聚焦贝佐斯&quot;造出了什么&quot;，与其他几卷分工明确：生平卷讲他的人生轨迹，思想方法卷讲他怎么想、怎么决策，影响与评价卷讲后世如何评说；本卷则集中呈现那些可以指着说&quot;这就是他的成就&quot;的具体产物——公司、业务、产品和文本。</p>\n<p>全卷按&quot;由大到小、由实到虚&quot;的逻辑分为三章，建议顺序阅读。第一章&quot;亚马逊公司&quot;是地基，讲这家&quot;万物公司&quot;如何从书店长成帝国，以及驱动它持续增长的&quot;飞轮效应&quot;。第二章&quot;AWS 与 Kindle&quot;聚焦两条最具代表性的业务线：AWS 既开创了云计算产业、又是养活整个帝国的盈利引擎，2025 年贡献了集团约七成营业利润；Kindle 与 Echo 则展示了贝佐斯&quot;与其被颠覆不如自我颠覆&quot;的硬件勇气。第三章&quot;致股东信&quot;转向更虚但同样重要的成就——贝佐斯二十四封致股东信所凝结的经营原则，本身就是商业史上的经典文献。</p>\n<p>需要说明的是，贝佐斯的成就并不止于亚马逊。2000 年他创立太空公司 Blue Origin，2021 年 7 月 20 日亲自乘 New Shepard 飞上太空，2025 年 New Glenn 重型火箭首飞入轨；2013 年他以 2.5 亿美元个人买下《华盛顿邮报》；他还以约 100 亿美元设立 Bezos Earth Fund 资助气候事业，并通过 Day One Fund 兴办面向低收入社区的免费幼儿园。这些跨越商业、太空、媒体与慈善的志业，在本人物的生平卷中有专门展开，参见 <a href=\"../life-and-times/empire-and-space/blue-origin-and-beyond\">蓝色起源与未来</a> 与 <a href=\"../life-and-times/empire-and-space/building-an-empire\">构建帝国</a>。本卷则把镜头对准那个让这一切成为可能的核心——亚马逊。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"amazon-the-company","title":"亚马逊公司","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/amazon-the-company","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-everything-company","title":"万物公司：亚马逊","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/amazon-the-company/the-everything-company"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-flywheel","title":"飞轮效应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/amazon-the-company/the-flywheel"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"aws-and-kindle","title":"AWS 与 Kindle","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/aws-and-kindle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aws-the-profit-engine","title":"AWS 盈利引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/aws-and-kindle/aws-the-profit-engine"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kindle-and-devices","title":"Kindle 与硬件创新","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/aws-and-kindle/kindle-and-devices"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"shareholder-letters","title":"致股东信","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/shareholder-letters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-annual-letters","title":"历年致股东信","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/shareholder-letters/the-annual-letters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"enduring-principles","title":"不朽的原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/jeff-bezos/major-works/shareholder-letters/enduring-principles"}]}]}